{"hymn":"FR73","parent":"E432","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Amour qui ne me lâche pas","subtitle":"","syl":{"n1":["A","i"],"n2":["mour","t"],"n3":"qui","n4":"ne","n5":"me","n6":["lâ","i"],"n7":["che","t"],"n8":"pas,","n10":"Mon","n11":["â","i"],"n12":["me","t"],"n13":"se","n14":["re","i"],"n15":["pose","t"],"n16":"en","n17":"Toi.","n19":"Je","n20":"rends","n21":"la","n22":"vie","n23":"que","n24":"je","n25":"Te","n26":"dois,","n28":"Pour","n29":"qu'en","n30":"Ton","n31":["pro","i"],"n32":["fond","t"],"n33":["o","i"],"n34":["cé","m"],"n35":["an,","t"],"n36":"Son","n37":"flot","n38":"soit","n39":["dé","i"],"n40":["bor","m"],"n41":["dant.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Lumière éclairant mon sentier,","Je rends ma faible flamme à Toi.","Mon cœur son rayon Te renvoie,","Pour qu'en Ton soleil si brillant,","Son éclat soit plus grand."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Ô joie, même dans les douleurs,","Mon cœur demeure ouvert à Toi.","Dans la pluie l'arc-en-ciel je vois,","Ce que Dieu promet n'est pas vain,","Mes pleurs ont une fin."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Ô croix, révélant mon regard,","Je n'ose m'éloigner de Toi.","Ma gloire dans la boue se noie,","Le sang de ce lieu a coulé,","Jésus en moi est né."]}]}